## Three Baselines — All From Actual Dataset

No leaderboard — closed competition.
Rule-based baselines only. No model training.

| Baseline | MAPE | MAE | What it tells you |
|----------|------|-----|------------------|
| Store historical average | 7.47% | $79,480 | Sanity floor — even simple rules beat this |
| Naive last-week | 7.15% | $79,126 | Does model capture weekly trend? |
| Same week last year | 6.31% | $61,384 | Does model capture seasonality? Primary |
| **LightGBM** | **4.41%** | **$38,661** | **Final model** |

**Why same week last year is primary baseline:**
Annual seasonality dominates retail forecasting.
Thanksgiving 2012 mirrors Thanksgiving 2011.
Confirmed by SHAP — lag_52 is strongest feature
with up to $800K impact per prediction.

**Why MAPE used for model selection (not RMSE):**
Normality test confirmed non-normal right-skewed
data. RMSE unfairly weights large-store errors
10x more than small-store errors across 10x
revenue range ($263K to $2.55M). MAPE treats
all 45 stores equally — correct for this problem.

**Improvement vs primary baseline:**
MAPE 6.31% → 4.41% — 1.90pp
MAE $61,384 → $38,661 — $22,723 per store weekly

**Improvement vs naive:**
MAPE 7.15% → 4.41% — 2.74pp
MAE $79,126 → $38,661 — $40,465 per store weekly

---

## Business Impact — Decision Chain

**Stockout and overstock risk:**

| Baseline | MAPE | High-error weeks | Risk frequency |
|----------|------|-----------------|----------------|
| Naive last-week | 7.15% | ~18% | Every 5th week |
| Same week last year | 6.31% | ~15% | Every 7th week |
| LightGBM | 4.41% | ~7% | Every 14th week |

**Dollar chain (assumptions stated):**
Forecast error → inventory order error → cost
- $79,126 → $38,661 per store weekly vs naive
- $61,384 → $38,661 per store weekly vs primary
- 45 stores × $40,465 = $1.82M chain-wide weekly
- Assumption: forecast error = inventory order error
- Actual depends on margin and safety stock policy

**Store-specific decisions:**
- Stores 39 and 42: under-predict 5-6% — add 6% buffer
- Store 44 ($280K store): $15K absolute threshold
- 41 of 45 stores: production ready immediately

