## Human Decision Log

| Decision | Standard | Mine | Why |
|----------|----------|------|-----|
| Outliers | Remove | Keep | Real holiday peaks |
| Metric | RMSE | MAPE | Non-normal, 10x range |
| Split | Random | Chronological | No leakage |
| Model selection | RMSE | MAPE | Fair across stores |
| Fuel_Price | Remove | Keep | SHAP 6th feature |
| Christmas | Peak | Decline | Post-holiday drop |
| Encoding | Raw week | Cyclic | Week 52 and 1 adjacent |

